---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: প্রোডাক্টিভ মুসলিম ৩৬০°
description: "মানুষ যেন বলে — এই মসজিদ থাকলে সমাজ নিরাপদ। ইবাদত, শিক্ষা, সেবা ও নেতৃত্ব — বায়তুন নাযাত জামে মসজিদ, শাহজালাল উপশহর, সিলেট। Baitun Najat Jame Masjid, Sylhet."
lang: bn
---
{% import "macros/brand.njk" as b %}
{% set img = "/images/event-2026" %}

{# The page is one argument, told in order: the promise (hero) → what is happening now
   (carousel) → proof (numbers) → the model behind it (360° wheel) → the rhythm you can join
   (monthly timeline) → help when it matters (services) → the people who do it (Ansar) →
   where to watch (Najat TV) → the promise again, with the ways to be part of it.
   Each section has its own shape, so no two neighbours look alike. #}

{# ══ HERO ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   Where, who, the one idea, the actions. Beside it the evidence: a volunteer in the
   masjid's vest bent over a child's paper, and the masjid's own mihrab — both inside the
   arch, over the lime sun. Consent for the 2026 set: brand/references/photography/MANIFEST.md. #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  {{ b.pattern("hero-lattice", "ink") }}
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-10 pb-14 md:pt-16 md:pb-20 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] md:items-center">
    <div>
      {{ b.pill("শাহজালাল উপশহর, সিলেট", "pin") }}
      <h1 lang="bn" class="mt-6 font-display font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight text-olive-deep text-balance">{{ site.nameBn }}</h1>
      {# The platform line — the committee's own closing words, framed as an aim. #}
      <p lang="bn" class="mt-5 max-w-xl font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-snug text-ink text-balance">{{ model.promise }}</p>
      <p lang="bn" class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">ইবাদত, শিক্ষা, সেবা ও নেতৃত্ব — এক মসজিদকে ঘিরে, সবার জন্য।</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {{ b.btn("/programs/", "কর্মসূচি দেখুন") }}
        {{ b.btn("/donate/", "দান করুন", "secondary") }}
      </div>
      <p lang="en" class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-sm text-ink-muted">Baitun Najat Jame Masjid, Shahjalal Upashahar, Sylhet. What we want our neighbours to say: with this masjid here, the community is safe.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
      <div data-bleed aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 md:-right-12 w-44 h-44 md:w-60 md:h-60 rounded-pill bg-lime"></div>
      <div class="relative grid grid-cols-[1.35fr_1fr] items-end gap-4">
        {{ b.archFigure(img + "/volunteer-two-boys-portrait.jpg", "মসজিদের ভেস্ট পরা এক স্বেচ্ছাসেবক এক শিশুর খাতা দেখে দিচ্ছেন", null, "3/4", "45% 40%", "", true) }}
        {{ b.archFigure(img + "/exam-mihrab-view.jpg", "মসজিদের মিহরাবের সামনে শিশুরা পরীক্ষা দিচ্ছে", null, "3/5", "62% 45%", "mb-10", true) }}
      </div>
      <p lang="bn" class="relative mt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">৩য় সীরাত প্রতিযোগিতা ২০২৬ — মসজিদের স্বেচ্ছাসেবকরা সারাদিন প্রতিটি সারিতে।</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ══ PRAYER TIMES — from the committee's sheet; no complete table, no block. #}
{% if prayer.times %}
<section id="prayer" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 section-b scroll-mt-24">
  <div class="rounded-lg bg-surface border border-line p-6 md:p-8 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] md:items-start">
    <div>
      {{ b.pill("নামাজের সময়", "clock") }}
      {% if prayer.jumuah %}<p lang="bn" class="mt-5 text-lg text-ink">জুমার জামাত <span class="font-semibold">{{ prayer.jumuah.iqamah | bn }}</span></p>{% endif %}
      {% if prayer.updated %}<p lang="bn" class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">হালনাগাদ: {{ prayer.updated | bn }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {{ b.prayerTable(prayer.times) }}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{# ══ EVENTS CAROUSEL ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   From the admins' sheet (src/_data/activities.js): running, then upcoming, then the most
   recent past. A native scroll-snap row — swipe with no JS; the arrows appear only once JS
   runs and there is something to scroll. #}
{% if activities.carousel.length %}
<section class="bg-surface border-y border-line" aria-labelledby="activities-title">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-16 md:pt-20 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      {{ b.pill("আয়োজন", "calendar") }}
      <h2 id="activities-title" lang="bn" class="mt-5 font-display font-extrabold text-3xl text-olive-deep text-balance">চলমান ও সাম্প্রতিক আয়োজন</h2>
    </div>
    <div data-carousel-nav hidden>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <button type="button" data-dir="-1" aria-label="আগের আয়োজন" class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-pill border border-ink/30 text-ink hover:bg-ink/5 disabled:opacity-40"><span class="inline-flex rotate-180">{{ b.icon("arrow", "1.3em") }}</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-dir="1" aria-label="পরের আয়োজন" class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-pill border border-ink/30 text-ink hover:bg-ink/5 disabled:opacity-40">{{ b.icon("arrow", "1.3em") }}</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <ul data-scroller class="mt-8 flex gap-4 md:gap-6 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-px-6 px-6 pb-6">
      {% for a in activities.carousel %}
      <li class="snap-start shrink-0 flex w-[82%] sm:w-[46%] lg:w-[calc((100%-3rem)/3)]">{{ b.activityCard(a) }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
      {# Fewer than three events leaves a blank third of the desktop row: fill it with the way on. #}
      {% if activities.carousel.length < 3 %}<li class="hidden lg:flex snap-start shrink-0 lg:w-[calc((100%-3rem)/3)]"><a href="/events/" lang="bn" class="group w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-ink/25 p-8 text-center text-ink hover:border-olive-deep hover:bg-paper transition-colors">{{ b.iconDisc("calendar", "3.5rem") }}<span class="font-display font-extrabold text-xl leading-snug">সব আয়োজন দেখুন</span><span class="text-ink-muted leading-normal">আসন্ন ও সম্পন্ন — মসজিদের সব আয়োজন এক পাতায়</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold group-hover:underline">আয়োজন {{ b.icon("arrow") }}</span></a></li>{% endif %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 section-b">
    {# On desktop the tile in the row says this already, when there is one. #}
    <a href="/events/" lang="bn" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-ink hover:underline {{ 'lg:hidden' if activities.carousel.length < 3 }}">সব আয়োজন দেখুন {{ b.icon("arrow") }}</a>
  </div>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var s = document.querySelector("[data-scroller]"), nav = document.querySelector("[data-carousel-nav]");
      if (!s || !nav) return;
      var btns = nav.querySelectorAll("button");
      function step() { var li = s.querySelector("li"); return li ? li.getBoundingClientRect().width + 24 : s.clientWidth; }
      function update() {
        nav.hidden = s.scrollWidth <= s.clientWidth + 2;
        btns[0].disabled = s.scrollLeft <= 2;
        btns[1].disabled = s.scrollLeft + s.clientWidth >= s.scrollWidth - 2;
      }
      btns.forEach(function (b) { b.addEventListener("click", function () { s.scrollBy({ left: step() * +b.dataset.dir, behavior: "smooth" }); }); });
      s.addEventListener("scroll", update, { passive: true });
      addEventListener("resize", update);
      update();
    })();
  </script>
</section>
{% endif %}

{# ══ AT A GLANCE — the proof, on a lime ground (ink only on lime). ════════════ #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-lime text-ink">
  {{ b.pattern("glance-lattice", "olive", 64) }}
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 strip-y">
    <h2 lang="bn" class="font-display font-extrabold text-2xl md:text-3xl">এক নজরে</h2>
    {# 2×2 until lg: four 88px numerals don't fit a 768px row ("২৪/৭" ran into its neighbour). #}
    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-x-6 gap-y-10">
      {{ b.stat(event.participants, "শিশু-কিশোর", "৩য় সীরাত প্রতিযোগিতায়", "lime", "text-5xl lg:text-6xl") }}
      {{ b.stat(model.programs.length, "নিয়মিত কর্মসূচি", "হালাকা থেকে তারাবীহ", "lime", "text-5xl lg:text-6xl") }}
      {{ b.stat("২৪/৭", "জানাজা সাপোর্ট", "গোসল, কাফন ও দাফন", "lime", "text-5xl lg:text-6xl") }}
      {{ b.stat(model.ansar.teams.length, "স্বেচ্ছাসেবক টিম", "যুবকদের হাতে মসজিদের কাজ", "lime", "text-5xl lg:text-6xl") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ══ THE MODEL — the 360° wheel, pillars named around it ════════════════════ #}
<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 section-y grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.15fr] md:items-center">
  <div>
    {{ b.pill(model.name, "sparkle") }}
    <h2 lang="bn" class="mt-5 font-display font-extrabold text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-tight text-olive-deep text-balance">ছয় দিক থেকে গড়ে ওঠা একটি মসজিদ</h2>
    <p lang="bn" class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">{{ model.vision }}</p>
    {# Wherever the wheel hides its labels (below sm, and at md), name the pillars in text. #}
    <ol class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-3 sm:hidden md:grid lg:hidden">
      {% for p in model.pillars %}
      <li><a href="/360/#{{ p.id }}" lang="bn" class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-ink"><span class="text-olive-deep">{{ b.icon(p.icon, "1.2em") }}</span>{{ p.title }}</a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <a href="/360/" lang="bn" class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-ink hover:underline">পুরো ৩৬০° মডেল দেখুন {{ b.icon("arrow") }}</a>
  </div>
  {{ b.wheel(model.pillars) }}
</section>

{# ══ THE RHYTHM — a month as a line you can join ═════════════════════════════
   Paper markers on olive-deep: lime and olive-deep must never touch as fills (2.89:1). #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-olive-deep text-paper">
  {{ b.pattern("rhythm-lattice", "paper") }}
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 section-y">
    <h2 lang="bn" class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-tight">প্রতি মাসের ছন্দ</h2>
    <p lang="bn" class="mt-3 text-lg">মাসের চার সপ্তাহে চারটি আয়োজন — যেকোনোটিতে যোগ দিন।</p>
    {# The connector runs marker centre to marker centre: col 4's marker sits at 75% + 2.875rem. #}
    <ol class="relative mt-8 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-6">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-7 top-2 bottom-2 w-0.5 bg-paper/30 md:left-7 md:right-[calc(25%-2.875rem)] md:top-7 md:bottom-auto md:h-0.5 md:w-auto"></div>
      {% for w in model.monthlyFlow %}
      <li class="relative flex items-center gap-5 md:flex-col md:items-start md:gap-4">
        <span class="relative inline-flex w-14 h-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-pill bg-paper text-ink font-display font-extrabold text-2xl">{{ w.week | bn }}</span>
        <div>
          <p lang="bn" class="text-sm">সপ্তাহ {{ w.week | bn }}</p>
          <p lang="bn" class="font-display font-bold text-xl leading-snug">{{ w.title }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-lg border border-paper/25 p-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <p lang="bn" class="text-lg"><span class="font-semibold">প্রতি জুমায়:</span> শিশুদের খুতবা — {{ model.childrenKhutbah.ages }}, {{ model.childrenKhutbah.when | replace("প্রতি জুমায় ", "") }}।</p>
      {{ b.btn("/programs/", "সব কর্মসূচি", "paperOutline") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ══ HELP WHEN IT MATTERS — services by weight, not in a row of equals ════════
   The two that answer a phone at 2am get the big olive card and the one call button;
   relief and medical camps sit beside it; the store is a strip beneath. #}
<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 section-y">
  {{ b.sectionHead("Rahma Services", "বিপদের সময় পাশে", "heart") }}
  <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-olive-deep text-paper p-6 sm:p-8 md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 flex flex-col">
      {{ b.pattern("sos-lattice", "paper", 56) }}
      <p class="relative font-display font-extrabold text-6xl md:text-7xl leading-none">২৪/৭</p>
      <p lang="bn" class="relative mt-3 text-lg">দিন হোক বা রাত — এক কলেই মসজিদের টিম।</p>
      <ul class="relative mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2">
        {% for s in model.services %}{% if s.id == "janazah" or s.id == "ambulance" %}
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="mt-1 inline-flex w-11 h-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-pill bg-paper text-ink">{{ b.icon(s.icon, "50%") }}</span>
          <div>
            <p lang="bn" class="font-display font-bold text-xl">{{ s.title }}</p>
            <p lang="bn" class="mt-1">{{ s.items[0] }}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="relative mt-auto pt-10">{{ b.callButton(site.phones[0], "কল করুন", "paper") }}</div>
    </div>
    {% for s in model.services %}{% if s.id == "relief" or s.id == "medical" %}
    {{ b.card(s.icon, s.title, s.items) }}
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    <a href="/services/#bazaar" class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-lg bg-lime text-ink px-6 py-5 hover:bg-lime/90">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-3"><span>{{ b.icon("bag", "1.5em") }}</span><span><span lang="en" class="font-bold">Najat Bazaar</span> <span lang="bn">— সুন্নাহ স্টোর, আয় যায় মসজিদ ফান্ডে</span></span></span>
      <span lang="bn" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">সব সেবা দেখুন {{ b.icon("arrow") }}</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ══ THE PEOPLE — Ansar of Najat, told by photographs ═══════════════════════ #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface border-y border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 section-y grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_1.25fr] items-end gap-4 order-2 md:order-1">
      {{ b.archFigure(img + "/volunteer-assisting.jpg", "স্বেচ্ছাসেবক প্রতিযোগীদের সহায়তা করছেন", null, "3/5", "35% 50%", "mb-12") }}
      {{ b.archFigure(img + "/volunteer-helping-girl.jpg", "একজন স্বেচ্ছাসেবক এক শিশুকে খাতা লিখতে সহায়তা করছেন", null, "3/4", "45% 50%") }}
    </div>
    <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
      {{ b.pill(model.ansar.brand, "people") }}
      <h2 class="mt-5 font-display font-extrabold text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-tight text-olive-deep text-balance"><span lang="en">{{ model.ansar.team }}</span></h2>
      <p lang="bn" class="mt-3 font-display font-bold text-2xl leading-snug text-ink">মসজিদের কাজ, যুবকদের হাতে।</p>
      <p lang="bn" class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">নিজস্ব রেজিস্ট্রেশন, ব্যাজ ও ইউনিফর্ম — চারটি টিমে কাজ করেন মসজিদের যুবকেরা।</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {% for t in model.ansar.teams %}
        <li lang="bn" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border border-ink/20 bg-paper px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-ink"><span class="text-olive-deep">{{ b.icon(t.icon, "1.1em") }}</span>{{ t.title }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {{ b.btn("/ansar/#register", "রেজিস্ট্রেশন করুন") }}
        {{ b.btn("/ansar/", "টিম সম্পর্কে জানুন", "secondary") }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ══ NAJAT TV — a real frame, not a list of icons ═══════════════════════════ #}
<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 section-y grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] md:items-center">
  {{ b.videoFrame("৩য় সীরাত প্রতিযোগিতা ২০২৬ থেকে।") }}
  <div>
    {{ b.pill("মিডিয়া", "broadcast") }}
    <h2 lang="bn" class="mt-5 font-display font-extrabold text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-tight text-olive-deep">নাজাত টিভি</h2>
    <ul class="mt-6 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
      {% for m in model.media %}
      <li class="flex items-center gap-4 py-3"><span class="text-olive-deep">{{ b.icon(m.icon, "1.4em") }}</span>
        <span><span lang="bn" class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ m.title }}</span>{% if m.detail %} <span lang="bn" class="text-ink-muted">· {{ m.detail }}</span>{% endif %}</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <a href="/media/" lang="bn" class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-ink hover:underline">নাজাত টিভি {{ b.icon("arrow") }}</a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ══ THE PROMISE, AGAIN — and the three ways to be part of it ════════════════ #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-olive-deep text-paper">
  {{ b.pattern("close-lattice", "paper") }}
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 md:py-28 text-center">
    <p lang="bn" class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-snug text-balance">“{{ model.promise }}”</p>
    <p lang="bn" class="mt-6 text-lg">এই কথাটি সত্যি হয় আপনার দানে, আপনার সময়ে, আপনার এক কলে।</p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      {{ b.btn("/donate/", "দান করুন", "paper") }}
      {{ b.btn("/ansar/#register", "স্বেচ্ছাসেবক হোন", "paperOutline") }}
      {{ b.callButton(site.phones[0], null, "paper") }}
    </div>
    <p lang="bn" class="mt-8 text-sm">{{ event.contact.imam }} · {{ event.contact.imamTitle }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
